    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That approach makes sense. I'm specifically worried about how the board will view the \"encroachment\" aspect, though. The easement is quite small, but it technically violates the new setback line. Are there any specific legal doctrines or administrative arguments I can use to minimize the perceived impact of this encroachment? I want to frame it as something negligible rather than a direct violation of the code.",
